# probe of 2e45d03). Without this half the Shader Cache app primes compute kernels with overlapping argument bindings and the
# macOS VFX treatment function as failures again (the r2507-shader fixes, iceland's adrenometal-shader-priming-fixes.patch,
# whose other hunks are now upstream). Applies on b25e48e alone; PrimeShaders.h is only compiled into the Shader Cache app's
